Private Sub call_fns()

On Error Resume Next
Call testselenium
Application.Wait (Now + TimeValue("00:00:10"))
Call RenameTodayDownloadedFile

End Sub                                                             'sub routine calls are made in sequence first extraction then rename sub is called
